{"product_id":"britannia-100-great-stories-from-british-history","title":"Britannia : 100 Great Stories from British History","description":"\u003cp\u003eKing Canute, Lady Godiva, Guy Fawkes, Bonnie Prince Charlie, Grace Darling and other famous names from 3000 years of history live again in these 100 tragic, comic, stirring tales of adventure, folly and wickedness. These stories, many of them virtually forgotten, are Britain's heritage, told and illustrated with such verve and colour that they are the perfect way to give present-day children a sense of the excitement of history.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 230 x 270\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Geraldine McCaughrean\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781858818764\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 264\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45663821562009,"sku":"5RG9781858818764","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68a5a2dc2112d_Britannia_-_100_Great_Stories_from_British_History_Geraldine_McCaughrean.jpg?v=1755941204","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/britannia-100-great-stories-from-british-history","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}